# Earthbend's "When that land dies or is put into exile, return it to the battlefield tapped under your control" is the
# delayed ability of the card whose earthbend it is (CR 701.66a, 603.7), whatever the object its ability resolves for has
# become. High Fae Trickster lets Bot1 cast spells as though they had flash (CR 702.8a): with Badgermole Cub's earthbend
# 1 on the stack targeting a Forest, Bot1 casts Cubwarden for its mutate cost over the Cub, on top (CR 702.140c), so the
# merged creature is a Cubwarden with the Cub's abilities too (CR 702.140e). The Forest becomes a 1/1 creature; Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 8, and it comes back tapped.

